<view class="container">
  <view class="card tip-card">
    <view class="card-title">按疾病 / 症状挂号</view>
    <view class="muted">根据常见症状推荐科室，减少挂错号。不确定时可挂内科普通号，由分诊台或医生进一步指引。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">请选择与您最接近的描述</view>
    <view
      wx:for="{{list}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="disease-row"
      data-item="{{item}}"
      bindtap="onSelect"
    >
      <view>
        <view class="disease-name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.hint}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="dept-tag">→ {{item.deptName}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
